{
  "id": "vp.presentation.basic.001",
  "description": "The presentation flow, end to end: the authorization request by value with a DCQL query, the verifier trust through the PDP, the host match against the query, the consent, the host-constructed VP token, the DCQL \u00a78.1 restructure, and the direct_post submission.",
  "provenance": "spec",
  "generator": {
    "repo": "sirosfoundation/siros-wallet-core",
    "commit": "1796021df43a575a2ff4a56d7253e66f523b5362",
    "date": "2026-11-03"
  },
  "spec_refs": [
    "OpenID4VP 1.0 section 8.1 (the vp_token object keyed by credential query id)",
    "OpenID4VP 1.0 section 5.2 (the client metadata)",
    "d.vp.jarm-refusal-not-sent in docs/decisions.md (the decline rule this vector does not exercise)",
    "d.vci.wia-via-wallet-provider in docs/decisions.md (the unscripted attestation ask is the best-effort refusal)"
  ],
  "setup": {
    "time": 1700000000,
    "entropy_seed": 42,
    "pdp": {
      "trusted": true,
      "decision": "in the registry"
    }
  },
  "script": [
    {
      "wmp_in": {
        "method": "wmp.flow.start",
        "params": {
          "flow_id": "flow-vp-presentation-001",
          "flow_type": "oid4vp",
          "params": {
            "client_id": "x509_san_dns:verifier.example",
            "nonce": "nonce-vp-001",
            "response_uri": "https://verifier.example/response",
            "response_mode": "direct_post",
            "state": "state-vp-001",
            "dcql_query": {
              "credentials": [
                {
                  "id": "pid-query",
                  "meta": {
                    "vct_values": [
                      "urn:pid"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "degree-query",
                  "meta": {
                    "vct_values": [
                      "urn:degree"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "host_ask": {
        "expect": {
          "kind": "match",
          "inputs": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-presentation-001",
            "dcql_query": {
              "credentials": [
                {
                  "id": "pid-query",
                  "meta": {
                    "vct_values": [
                      "urn:pid"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "degree-query",
                  "meta": {
                    "vct_values": [
                      "urn:degree"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "verifier": {
              "client_id": "x509_san_dns:verifier.example",
              "domain": "verifier.example",
              "trusted": true
            }
          }
        },
        "answer": {
          "value": {
            "selections": [
              {
                "credential_query_id": "pid-query",
                "credential_id": "cred-pid-001",
                "disclosed_claims": [
                  "given_name"
                ]
              },
              {
                "credential_query_id": "degree-query",
                "credential_id": "cred-degree-001",
                "disclosed_claims": []
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "host_ask": {
        "expect": {
          "kind": "consent"
        },
        "answer": {
          "value": {
            "consented": true
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "host_ask": {
        "expect": {
          "kind": "presentation",
          "inputs": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-presentation-001",
            "audience": "x509_san_dns:verifier.example",
            "nonce": "nonce-vp-001",
            "response_uri": "https://verifier.example/response",
            "selections": [
              {
                "credential_query_id": "pid-query",
                "credential_id": "cred-pid-001"
              },
              {
                "credential_query_id": "degree-query",
                "credential_id": "cred-degree-001"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "answer": {
          "value": {
            "vp_token": "token-pid-001\ntoken-degree-001"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "http_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "https://verifier.example/response",
          "purpose": "DirectPost",
          "form": {
            "state": "state-vp-001"
          }
        },
        "reply": {
          "status": 200,
          "body": {
            "redirect_uri": "https://verifier.example/done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-presentation-001",
            "step": "request_parsed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-presentation-001",
            "step": "trust_evaluated"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-presentation-001",
            "step": "transaction_data_validated"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.progress",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-presentation-001",
            "step": "credential_selected"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "wmp_out": {
        "expect": {
          "method": "wmp.flow.complete",
          "params": {
            "flow_id": "flow-vp-presentation-001",
            "result": {
              "presented": true,
              "credential_ids": [
                "cred-pid-001",
                "cred-degree-001"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "notes": "The second scenario file, exercising the presentation seam: the match ask carries the DCQL query and the verifier info, the presentation ask carries the selections, the audience, the nonce and the response endpoint, and the submitted vp_token is the DCQL \u00a78.1 object. The direct_post form's vp_token member is free (the restructured JSON is engine-built); the state is asserted."
}
